<title>UK: Petrak oil inspectors plan African expansion.</title>
<headline>Petrak oil inspectors plan African expansion.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>London-based crude oil and refined products inspectors Petrak said on Friday it was planning to expand its activities in Africa.</p>
<p>A new office in Gabon was due to open on Friday. From the beginning of October, Petrak would also operate out of Congo and Morocco, covering Tunisia and Algeria.</p>
<p>Later in October an office should open in Cape Town, South Africa, the company said.</p>
<p>Petrak said it was also planning to open three more offices before the end of the year, but did not specify where.</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
